[PrintTextModified Text:不知跑了多远。|#0105Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可和玛格的身影都不见了。<br>看守、典狱长和梅露露的气息也消失了。|#0105Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛成了孤身一人<br>——回到了监牢前。|#0105Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她无力地跪倒在地，蜷缩成一团。|#0105Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（已经没有人在了。也无处可逃了）|#0105Adv08_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我什么都没做到）|#0105Adv08_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground Intensity:0.5 FadeDuration:0

; ＠備考◆絶望で泣く

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊——啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！|#0105Adv08_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜啊啊啊啊啊啊——啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0105Adv08_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊啊、啊啊呜——啊啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0105Adv08_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛再也无法忍受，<br>她浑身颤抖，不断发出悲痛欲绝的哭喊。|#0105Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

